{"title": "Execution Notice", "pageid": 51865, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Execution_Notice", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Note_J_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Book_Note_J_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_J_Image.png.webp, /w/images/1/1c/Book_Note_J_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Execution Notice image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Book_Note_J_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_J_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Book_Note_J_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Execution Notice</b> is an announcement informing the citizens of Baldur's Gate about the death sentence passed on <a href=\"/wiki/Florrick\" title=\"Florrick\">Counsellor Florrick</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/38px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/50px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Notes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author: unknown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: unknown</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Copies of the Execution Notice are hanged on the walls in various points of <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<ul><li>*Florrick, former advisor to Duke Ravengard, has been found guilty of treacherous and seditious activity against the people of Baldur's Gate. She will be executed [five] days hence.* <i>(this version runs at the first read and until Florrick's fate is resolved, the number in parenthesis is counted down through long rests taken by the party)</i></li>\n<li>*The execution of Florrick, convicted traitor and seditionist, has been delayed for an indeterminate time.* <i>(if Florrick escaped the prison with the help of the party)</i></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Execution Notice, despite looking like a piece of parchment (like other notes and documents), upon interacting works like a signboard or a signpost, prompting its contents to be read by Narrator.</li>\n<li>Reading any copy of the Execution Notice for the first time starts the <b>time-sensitive</b> quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Free_Counsellor_Florrick\" title=\"Free Counsellor Florrick\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Free Counsellor Florrick\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Free_Counsellor_Florrick\" title=\"Free Counsellor Florrick\">Free Counsellor Florrick</a>.</li>\n<li>While progressing the quest, the Execution Notices' text changes.</li>\n<li>If the quest is resolved in Florrick's execution, the Execution Notices disappear from the walls.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201445\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 966/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11469/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6052/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 691602/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.980      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   25.980      1 -total\n 28.37%    7.370      4 Template:Icon_text\n 24.11%    6.265      1 Template:Main_only\n 21.09%    5.479      9 Template:Trim\n 20.51%    5.329      2 Template:Icon_link\n 16.66%    4.327      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.40%    4.262      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.00%    4.157      1 Template:Notes\n 11.46%    2.977      4 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:51865-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201445 and revision id 394793. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}